[meta] EMD Platform API Specification
Base URL: https://api.emd.dev/v2
Auth: Bearer token (JWT)

## [spec|done] Authentication
All API endpoints except /health require authentication via JWT Bearer token.
→ defines: api.emd#auth-endpoints
The token is obtained via POST /auth/login and refreshed via POST /auth/refresh.

Token format:
```json
{
  "sub": "user-uuid",
  "role": "admin|user|viewer",
  "exp": 1710000000,
  "iat": 1709913600
}
```

## [api|done] POST /auth/login
Authenticate user credentials and return JWT token pair.
→ generates: schema.emd#session-token

**Request:**
```json
{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "secure-password"
}
```

**Response 200:**
```json
{
  "access_token": "eyJhbGciOi...",
  "refresh_token": "eyJhbGciOi...",
  "expires_in": 86400,
  "token_type": "Bearer"
}
```

**Response 401:**
```json
{
  "error": "invalid_credentials",
  "message": "Email or password is incorrect"
}
```

## [api|done] GET /users
List all users with pagination.
→ consumes: model.emd#user

**Query parameters:**
| Param | Type | Default | Description |
|-------|------|---------|-------------|
| page | number | 1 | Page number |
| limit | number | 20 | Items per page (max 100) |
| role | string | — | Filter by role |
| search | string | — | Search by name or email |

**Response 200:**
```json
{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "email": "user@example.com",
      "name": "John Doe",
      "role": "user",
      "created_at": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z"
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 20,
    "total": 150,
    "pages": 8
  }
}
```

## [api|done] POST /users
Create a new user.
→ defines: model.emd#user

**Request:**
```json
{
  "email": "new-user@example.com",
  "name": "Jane Smith",
  "password": "secure-password",
  "role": "user"
}
```

**Response 201:**
```json
{
  "id": "uuid",
  "email": "new-user@example.com",
  "name": "Jane Smith",
  "role": "user",
  "created_at": "2024-06-15T08:00:00Z"
}
```

## [api|done] GET /documents
List EMD documents.

**Response 200:**
```json
{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "filename": "project.emd",
      "type": "project",
      "section_count": 45,
      "updated_at": "2024-06-15T12:00:00Z"
    }
  ],
  "meta": { "page": 1, "limit": 20, "total": 12, "pages": 1 }
}
```

## [api|done] POST /documents/parse
Parse EMD source text and return AST.

**Request:**
```json
{
  "source": "## [task|done] Hello World\nContent here."
}
```

**Response 200:**
```json
{
  "sections": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "section_type": "task",
      "status": "done",
      "title": "Hello World",
      "source_span": { "start": 0, "end": 42 }
    }
  ]
}
```

## [schema|done] User Model
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["id", "email", "name", "role", "created_at"],
  "properties": {
    "id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
    "email": { "type": "string", "format": "email", "maxLength": 255 },
    "name": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 100 },
    "role": { "type": "string", "enum": ["admin", "user", "viewer"] },
    "created_at": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
    "updated_at": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" }
  }
}
```

## [schema|done] Session Token
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "description": "JWT access token payload",
  "properties": {
    "sub": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid", "description": "User ID" },
    "role": { "type": "string", "enum": ["admin", "user", "viewer"] },
    "exp": { "type": "number", "description": "Expiration timestamp" },
    "iat": { "type": "number", "description": "Issued at timestamp" }
  }
}
```

## [schema|done] Error Response
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "description": "Standard error response for all endpoints",
  "required": ["error", "message"],
  "properties": {
    "error": { "type": "string", "description": "Machine-readable error code" },
    "message": { "type": "string", "description": "Human-readable error message" },
    "details": {
      "type": "array",
      "description": "Validation error details",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "field": { "type": "string" },
          "message": { "type": "string" }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

